OL,3,GNEWSAMini-marts told to shut down over
OL,4,Aillegal tobacco
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive shops in a seaside town have been
OL,7,Ftold to close immediately after hidden
OL,8,Fstashes of tens of thousands of
OL,9,Fcigarettes and packs of tobacco were
OL,10,Fdiscovered.
OL,12,FThe mini-mart type stores were at the
OL,13,Fcentre of 14 raids which followed what
OL,14,FGreat Yarmouth Borough Council
OL,15,Fdescribed as months of intelligence-led
OL,16,Fraids.
OL,18,FIt issued the businesses with immediate
OL,19,Fclosure notices and has applied for a
OL,20,Fcourt order which could see them remain
OL,21,Fshut for longer.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
