OL,3,GNEWSAMini-marts told to shut down over
OL,4,Aillegal tobacco
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Undercover test purchases highlighted
OL,7,Fpersistent criminal behaviour;  we now
OL,8,Fhave the evidence we need to hit them
OL,9,Fwhere it really hurts and shut the
OL,10,Fbusinesses down," said Paul Wells, the
OL,11,Fcabinet member responsible for
OL,12,Flicensing.
